package app.lensly.app.export

/**
 * The frames of the AirVault pairing that Lensly exports for one labelled wallet: two Ethereum accounts, three Bitcoin accounts, and one Solana
 * and one Algorand account, which a new wallet starts with. The first account of Ethereum and of Bitcoin has a name, a label and a group, and
 * the others are named by their Auto-Names. WalletStoreBitcoinTest records them from
 * Lensly, and Lumio's pairing test reads the same frames, so the two apps agree on what a pairing carries. Re-record them only when the
 * pairing itself changes.
 *
 * [FRAMES] is the version-7 code with the body stored as it is, which the JVM tests write.
 */
object LabelledPairingGolden {
    val FRAMES: List<String> = listOf(
        "UR:X-AIRVAULT-PAIRING/1-",
        "UR:X-AIRVAULT-PAIRING/2-",
        "UR:X-AIRVAULT-PAIRING/3-",
    )
}
